# vhs tape for the repoglance demo GIF.
# Install vhs (https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs), then run:
#   vhs assets/demo.tape
# Produces assets/demo.gif — embed it at the top of the README.

Output assets/demo.gif

Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 800
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Dracula"

Type "repoglance ."
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 4s
